- Bonding trips and events;
- 14 day-off per year along with other benefits according to the company's regulation;
- Chances for promotion and transfer.
- Rotational shift schedule;
- Weekend work required;
- One day off per week on a flexible weekday (Monday–Friday).

jobDescription:
